['q01','direction','DIRECTION','When you ask AI to create something important, how clearly do you define the destination?',['Extremely clearly','I define the destination precisely.'],['Very clearly','I usually know what great looks like.'],['Fairly clearly','I give AI a clear direction, then refine it.'],['Somewhat clearly','I have the destination, but it evolves.'],['I figure it out as I go','The first result often helps me discover what I want.']],
