['q03','direction','DIRECTION','How consistently do you give AI the context it needs before asking it to solve an important problem?',['Almost always','I make sure AI understands the situation first.'],['Very often','I provide context whenever the task matters.'],['Often','I usually give useful background information.'],['Sometimes','I add context when AI gets confused.'],['Rarely','I usually get straight to the request.']],
