['q05','communication','COMMUNICATION','How consistently do you give AI the background information that changes how a problem should be solved?',['Almost always','I make sure AI has the relevant situation first.'],['Very often','I provide important background whenever it matters.'],['Often','I usually provide useful background.'],['Sometimes','I add background when the first answer misses context.'],['Rarely','I usually start with the immediate request.']],
['q06','communication','COMMUNICATION','How well do you recognize which details are important enough for AI to know before it begins?',['Extremely well','I quickly identify the details that materially affect the outcome.'],['Very well','I usually know what context matters most.'],['Fairly well','I identify the major details and refine later.'],['Somewhat well','I often discover important context during the conversation.'],['Not very well yet','I tend to provide details only when they become necessary.']],
['q07','systemsThinking','SYSTEMS THINKING','How effectively do you correct AI when it misunderstands what you want?',['Extremely effectively','I diagnose the misunderstanding and redirect precisely.'],['Very effectively','I usually correct AI quickly.'],['Fairly effectively','I can usually get things back on track.'],['Sometimes','I often need several attempts.'],['Not very effectively','I often abandon the direction and start again.']],
['q08','systemsThinking','SYSTEMS THINKING','How effectively do you use feedback from one AI result to produce a better next result?',['Extremely effectively','Every revision gives AI specific information about what to improve.'],['Very effectively','I usually give useful feedback and get better results.'],['Fairly effectively','I make useful corrections as I go.'],['Sometimes','My feedback is often fairly general.'],['Not very effectively','I often start over instead of diagnosing the issue.']],
['q09','systemsThinking','SYSTEMS THINKING','When AI gives you a result that is close but not quite right, how do you normally work with it?',['Diagnose and improve it','I identify what is missing and direct the next version.'],['Refine it','I give feedback and continue improving the result.'],['Try another version','I ask AI to make another attempt.'],['Make a few changes','I fix obvious issues and move forward.'],['Usually accept it','I normally use the first useful result.']],
