['q11','evaluation','EVALUATION','How consistently do you verify important AI-generated information before relying on it?',['Almost always','I verify important claims before relying on them.'],['Very often','I verify information when accuracy matters.'],['Often','I check important information most of the time.'],['Sometimes','I verify things when something feels questionable.'],['Rarely','I generally trust useful-looking answers.']],
